## Official Reference-Axis Map — Structure Only

- [BLEU DE CHANEL Parfum](https://www.chanel.com/us/fragrance/p/107180/bleu-de-chanel-parfum-spray/) contributes the abstract transition **invigorating freshness -> warm cedar/sandalwood fullness -> dense aromatic-woody trail**.
- [Prada Luna Rossa Carbon](https://www.prada.com/ww/en/pradasphere/fragrances/prada-luna-rossa/prada-luna-rossa-carbon.html) contributes **air/mineral freshness -> metallic lavender tension -> patchouli wood and dry ambroxan**.
- [Prada Luna Rossa Ocean Le Parfum](https://www.prada-beauty.com/fragrance/luna-rossa/luna-rossa-ocean-le-parfum/3614274089349.html) contributes **vigorous lemon aperture opposed to a darker rear pressure**. Its saffron/leathery-oak signature is an exclusion, not a donor accord.
- [PerfumersWorld Pink Pepper Essential Oil `7SC00941`](https://www.perfumersworld.com/essential-oils.php) establishes the supplier parent identity and describes a peppery, woody, spicy, ginger-like, aromatic, tropical, caryophyllene profile, relative impact 100, and ten-hour strip life. The parent is a proprietary mixture, so one MW/logP/VP, bottle-specific ODT/OAV, exact 10% basis, lot, and formula safety remain **HOLD**.
- [PerfumersWorld Dihydromyrcenol `3CK00150`](https://www.perfumersworld.com/view.php?pro_id=3CK00150) supports its fresh cool metallic lime/citrus/floral sports-fougere function and a supplier compound-use interval up to 8%. The CURRENT 320 uL dose is 4.848% raw concentrate. This is a design range check, not physical or safety proof.

These sources establish broad public axes only. This artifact does not infer any reference formula, reproduce a donor signature, or claim similarity.

## Named Identity Contract

**Name:** Pepper Current Parfum.  
**One-sentence identity:** a high-pressure Pink Pepper current races across cold citrus/mineral air, then becomes a warm cedar-sandalwood current without losing its rosy woody-spice identity.  
**Recognizable subject:** exact owned Pink Pepper — effervescent, rosy without becoming rose, berry-lit without fruit candy, gently woody, and spicy without hot Black Pepper.  
**Emotional effect:** immediate athletic acceleration followed by a dense but yielding Parfum interior.  
**Wear context:** polished sport, hot-weather evening, moving body, and dressed-casual use; not shower gel and not a static heavy extrait.  
**Allowed reference axes:** Bleu de Chanel Parfum freshness-to-wood fullness; Luna Rossa Carbon mineral fougere tension; Luna Rossa Ocean Le Parfum lemon-to-dark-pressure contrast.  
**Forbidden donor identities:** saffron leather, smoky oak, incense, sweet tonka/vanilla, pineapple/cassis/birch, calone melon, and a recognizable Chanel or Prada accord.  
**Minimum recognizable nucleus:** Pink Pepper stock + Dihydromyrcenol + grapefruit/lemon edge + restrained linalyl/lavender cloth + cedar/sandalwood rear.  

### Lead-Note Ownership Gate

| Ownership job | Owner | Observable requirement | Veto |
|---|---|---|---|
| opening object | Pink Pepper EO 10% stock | first free description is Pink Pepper or an integrated rosy-effervescent woody pepper | citrus, Dihydromyrcenol, lavender, aldehydic metal, or generic blue accord leads |
| heart transformation | Pink Pepper persistence through linalyl cloth, trace Rose Oxide, restrained AIMI, and moving Hedione/Hexyl air | pepper becomes smoother and more aromatic but stays classifiable | literal rose, violet makeup, lavender soap, muguet, or blank Hedione air |
| base recurrence | Pink Pepper residue recalled by cedar grain, vetiver root, tiny patchouli shadow, and AIMI woody-violet polish | 6-24 h residue recalls peppered current rather than only wood/musk | generic ambrox/Iso E, sandalwood cream, patchouli, or musk is the sole identity |

Raw mass is not leadership. Dihydromyrcenol, Hedione, Iso E Super, Sandalore, Benzyl Benzoate, and Romandolide may exceed the nominal Pink Pepper active equivalent only as declared motion, air, rear volume, yielding interior, quiet matrix, and projection functions. None is permitted to be the first named object.

