| warm current | peppered cedar grain, clean patchouli shadow, vetiver root, yielding sandalwood interior | Pink Pepper residue, Cedarwood oil Virginia, Clearwood, Vetiver EO, Patchouli EO, Sandalore, Ebanol | Hexyl Salicylate + AIMI + Ebanol |
| invariant cue | effervescent rosy woody spice moving forward through a dry aromatic fabric | exact Pink Pepper stock; Rose Oxide is only a trace surface lens | exact Pink Pepper dose ladder and no-lead control |

