| 95,655 normalized active-phase ppm quiet benzoate matrix | 110 uL Benzyl Benzoate; 24,981 normalized nominal active-phase ppm | deliberately undertranslated so DEP-borne Pink Pepper gains space without removing the sport engine; matrix effect is tested separately | negative-space and flattening effects NOT TESTED |
| exact natural Pink Pepper physics | proprietary PW compound has no meaningful single MW/logP/VP | pipeline cannot rank the hero against synthetics | composite/single-material OAV HOLD; any automated zero is invalid |
| lemon/ginger-like vigorous aperture | owned Lemon FCF, no Ginger | lemon supplies the motion while protecting Pink Pepper from another spice identity | Lemon exact-name composite OAV HOLD |
| smooth ambroxide with exact carrier/mass basis | Ambrofix 30% w/v, carrier unspecified | numerical screen can model 30%, but exact active-volume ppm is unresolved | stock-basis HOLD |
| tiny distal amber pressure | Amber Xtreme 10% w/w DEP | raw stock is exact; volume-active conversion is not | nominal ppm only; safety HOLD |
| exact safe finished product | no authorized mass ledger, IFRA/allergen reconciliation, stability, or physical test | no skin/release claim | HOLD / NOT AUTHORIZED |

Composite-natural coverage is applicable for Grapefruit FCF, Bontaux Lavender, Patchouli EO, and Vetiver EO (India). Pink Pepper remains identity-mismatched/proprietary; Lemon FCF, Clary Sage, and Cedarwood Virginia require exact applicable composite confirmation or remain HOLD. Natural-model output is a diagnostic floor, never a sensory verdict.

## Why 35 Rows

The formula is not 35 rows to imitate DHP or to improve a score. The rows form six reversible systems: exact Pink Pepper identity; athletic citrus/aromatic motion; mineral-air release; living-middle cloth; cedar/sandalwood Parfum interior; and dry woody-fabric recurrence. Seven low-evidence rows are predeclared for the 35-versus-28 compressed control. The complete version survives only if it beats or equals the compressed version on Pink Pepper leadership, sport recognition, transition, spatial planes, recurrence, comfort, liking, and takeover burden in replicated blinded blocks.

## Theory Decision

Pepper Current Parfum V1 is admitted as a **35-row clean-sheet TARGET / CURRENT theory hypothesis**. It corrects the old direction by using the exact Pink Pepper stock, raising the Pink Pepper center from 480 to 2,000 uL stock, raising Dihydromyrcenol from 60 to 320 uL neat, reducing Bontaux Lavender from 240 to 30 uL, reducing Helional from 100 to 30 uL, removing Azarbre/Labdanum/Black-Pepper proxy identity, using one outward musk, and rebuilding the rear around cedar plus fresh/soft sandalwood rather than a large generic woody-amber block. The last 400 uL moved from Benzyl Benzoate into Pink Pepper stock; this deliberately reduces quiet heavy matrix while bringing the nominal carrier-stripped Pink Pepper mapping onto its 45,000-ppm TARGET marker.

These are design changes, not evidence that the result smells better or sportier. No physical action is authorized.

**Final status:** THEORY ONLY / NOT TESTED / NO COMPOUNDING OR PROCUREMENT AUTHORIZED

